//////////OBJECTIVE 11 - DEAL WITH SHARKEY//////////

SCRIPT:mgfotr_hobbit028
"Hobbit: Don't let him go! He's a villain and a murderer. Kill him! Kill him!"
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_saruman058
"Sharkey: Yes, kill him, if you think there are enough of you! But do not think that I am powerless! \n Whoever strikes me shall be accursed. And if my blood stains the Shire, it shall never be healed!"
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_frodo182
"Your words are poison, Saruman. I will have you speak no more, slay him!"
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_saruman046
"I have done much that you will find hard to mend or undo in your lives. And it will be pleasant to think of that and set it against my injuries."
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_frodo183
"Do not believe him! I will not have him slain. It is useless to meet revenge with revenge."
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_frodo184
"Go, Saruman, by the speediest way!"
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_saruman059
"To the road again, Worm! These fine fellows and lordlings are turning us adrift again. Come along!"
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_saruman047
"It seems that Gandalf's impudence has taken root in you. All that suffering, and no lesson learned."
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_frodo185
"I offered you mercy, Saruman, and you repaid it with treachery. One ill turn deserves another - kill him."
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_frodo186
"Frodo: Stay your weapons!"
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_frodo187
"Frodo: He was great once, of a noble kind that we should not dare to raise our hands against. \n I would spare him, in the hope that he may find some cure."
END


SCRIPT:mgfotr_saruman060A
"Sharkey: You are wise, and cruel. You have robbed my revenge of sweetness, and now I am in debt to your mercy. I hate it and you!" 
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_saruman060B
"Sharkey: I will trouble you no more. But do not expect me to wish you health and long life. \n You will have neither. But that is not my doing. I merely foretell."
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_frodo188
"Frodo: Grima! You need not follow him!"
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_saruman064
"Sharkey: Follow! Follow, you wretched cur!"
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_frodo191
"Frodo: You can stay here a while, and rest ere you take to the road."
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_hobbit032
"Hobbit: We can't let the villain get away! Get him!"
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_saruman061
"Sharkey: No evil? Oh no! What of poor Lotho? You know, don't you, Worm? Will you tell them?"
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_wormtongue002
"Worm: No, no!"
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_saruman062
"Sharkey: Worm killed him. Poor fellow. Stabbed him in his sleep, I believe. Buried him, I hope; \n though Worm has been very hungry lately. You had better leave him to me."
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_wormtongue003
"Worm: You told me to!"
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_saruman063
"Sharkey: You do what Sharkey says, always, don't you, Worm? Well, now he says - follow! Follow, you wretched cur!"
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_wormtongue004
"Worm: No!"
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_frodo192
"Frodo: No!"
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_sam231
"Sam: This was the very last end of the War, I hope."
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_frodo193
"Frodo: I hope so too. To think it had to happen here, at the very door of Bag End."
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_sam232
"Sam: Now we must clean up the mess. And that'll take a lot of time and work."
END


